B.acx=new A.a2(B.ad7,["Catches a large ball with both hands","Climbs the rungs of a ladder of a playground slide and slide down without help","Can hold a pencil, crayon, or pen between her fingers and thumb like an adult does","Hops up and down on either foot at least one time without losing her balance or falling","Unbuttons at least one button","Colours mostly within the lines in a colouring book or within the lines of a 2-inch circle","Dresses and undresses without help","Washes his hands using soap and water and dry off with a towel without help","Names of two or more playmates, not including brothers and sisters?","Serves himself, takes food from one container to another or pours water from jug to a glass?","Follows three different directions using the words 'under,' 'between,' and 'middle'","Names five different colours, like red, blue, yellow, orange, black, white, or pink","Can identify difference between small and big objects","Follows simple one-step command  without cueing- like 'put the book on the table' and 'put the shoe under the chair'","Follows directions that are unrelated to one another","Names at least three items (animals) from a common category?"],t.w)
