B.acy=new A.a2(B.IO,["While lying on back Lifts the legs to look at the feet and/or put it in his mouth","Lying on tummy Tries to reach objects","While lying on tummy Push up on his /her hands to lift the whole chest","Crawls, rolls or moves in circle to get a toy that is beyond reach?","Look for a toy when they drop it","Look in the direction of your voice or loud sound"],t.w)
B.acz=new A.a2(B.IO,["Walks sideways holding onto furniture","Releases the toy from hand when you ask for it","Push hands into the sleeve during dressing","Tries to find toy that is hidden (Be sure the toy is completely hidden)","Follows one simple command, such as 'Come here', 'Give it to me' or 'Put it back' without your using gestures","Able to say three words, such as 'Mama', 'Dada' and 'Baba'"],t.w)
